            "review_title": "Review at Tartine Cafe",
            "review_text": "Ashley W\n9 contributions\n0\nLovely atmosphere and food\nJul 2025 • Family\nLovely breakfast, came 2 days whilst staying in HCMC. Beautiful interior however the place itself is a little hidden away. The fried eggs are cooked so nicely and the staff speak English well. \nMy family had breakfasts like the full English style breakfast, sourdough toast with homemade jam, butter and honey, fruit and yoghurt. The fresh juices are very tasty, but can be tangy. It is also a bakery so great options for breads and pastries.\nLots of great food and options, I definitely recommend to anyone looking for a place to eat throughout the day!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 12, 2025",
