            "review_title": "Review at Tartine Cafe",
            "review_text": "BillTuckerUS\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam51 contributions\n0\nCozy, welcoming cafe and bakery\nApr 2024 • Family\nWe started with the cheese and cold-cuts platter, margarita cocktails, and then moved on to individual selections. My wife and I shared a delicious steak and cheese sandwich. Others in our party got hamburgers, pork ribs, and the English breakfast. We all enjoyed the excellent service, food, and drink.\n\nThis is the third Tartine location that we have visited and the closest one to our house. We look forward to many return trips.\nRead more\nWritten April 16, 2024",
